"""Builds assets/showcase_master_multi.html: the master catalog of ms-presentation-deck v4.0.0.
Every slide is one pattern of the standard: structure, text families, tables, charts, engineering
diagrams, reference architectures with official icons, animated scenes, light-theme product mocks,
interactives, media and code. Trilingual chrome (eyebrow, title, captions, notes); technical bodies
stay in English. Run: python showcase_build.py <out.html>   (skeleton and who snippet come from ../assets)"""
import sys, os, re, base64
