              ('preToolUse is fail-closed', '<b>A crashed guard denies the tool.</b> A timeout does not. Keep the script local and under a second.'),
              ('Exit 2 means deny on the gates', '<b>On preToolUse and permissionRequest</b> stderr is shown and stdout is ignored, even if it says allow.'),
