             ('Secrets in the shell', 'Deny curl piped to bash and any command with a token flag; log the redacted attempt. The SIEM sees a pattern before a person does.'),
             ('The payments folder', 'ask on edits under src/payments and deny in the cloud; the reviewer sees every touch with a diff, never a surprise.'),
